    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\nLet’s make your program more personal!\r\n\r\nChange it so it:\r\n* asks someone for their **name** _or_ their **favorite food**, and\r\n* includes that response in the greeting.\r\n\r\n* **\r\n**Use the AI Tutor to GET HINTS or EXAMPLES for how to do this.**\r\n\r\nYou can click the \"Give an Example\" or \"Give a Hint\" button or ask questions like:\r\n* How do I ask someone for their name in Python?\r\n* Can you show me an example of a program that asks for input and prints it in a sentence?\r\n* How can I ask for someone's favorite food and include it in my greeting?\r\n* Can you explain what the `input()` function does?\r\n\r\n***Tip: Pick one idea from the Tutor and try it! You can always ask it to explain the code line-by-line.***",
